                <pb facs="0435" n="425" xml:id="pg425"/>

                <head>Appendix IV to IC–179C</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Austria</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">(Revised Article approved by M. Clemenceau, President Wilson
                    and Mr. Lloyd George on May 2nd, 1919)</p>
                <p>Germany acknowledges and will fully respect the independence of Austria within
                    the frontiers established by the present treaty as inalienable, except by
                    consent of the Council of the League of Nations.</p>
